		{"id":"8e313d7a842bcfd0","type":"text","text":"# Mark of Cain\nThose crests that have been marked by the [[Mark of Cain]] belong to the [[Children of Cain]]. Their symbol – a crude eye with a slash – is etched and hidden in the design of the crest somewhere. The mark also gives the crests their characteristic red glow.","x":520,"y":411,"width":300,"height":652}
